  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The number of distinct real roots of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now on rearranging we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>From above equation it is clearly visible that the root are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, hence it is monotonic in nature so it will have only one root other than&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;real distinct roots.</p></blockquote>",
